[{"id":3054967258,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc62Fxna","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?u=b7882c94f408976a2f79e8fe6e1ce27fbd48db74&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Tested this on VSCode:\n\n- `[br]` behaves strange, I have to use `[br][br]` to get a visible difference. Inserting new lines between code blocks doesn't work at all. Looking at the markdown: `\\n` is not a valid strategy for this. Markdown requires either a trailing `\\` or two trailing spaces to insert a new line. Using two [br] probably works because markdown treats it as different paragraphs. Using `\\` seems to be our best option since it allows inserting more than one new line:\n\\\n\\\nTwo new lines does not work with trailing spaces. So using `\\n\\\\` seems to be the way to go.\n- `[lb]Sprite2D[rb]` does not work correctly yet.\n- Underline is translated to strong emphasis (bold). I thinks that's a good approach given that markdown only has emphasis levels.\n- `[url]` does not work correctly, it seems the `[class_name]` transformation is applied afterwards, so the display text of the markdown link gets converted to inline code\n- Only showing gdscript for fenced Codeblocks is good, but if a sample is only available in C# we should fallback to it instead of showing no code at all. (Although this is not a blocker, given that the builtin tooltip doesn't fallback as well).\n\nIt would also be nice to add a basic test for `marked_documentation` to the LSP test suite. Not a requirement though.","state":"CHANGES_REQUESTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108497#pullrequestreview-3054967258","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108497","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108497#pullrequestreview-3054967258"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108497"}},"submitted_at":"2025-07-25T11:18:00Z","commit_id":null},{"id":3080973647,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc63o-1P","user":{"login":"NathanLovato","id":12694995,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNjk0OTk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12694995?u=e4abd5fa8b74c82c57955f490da199a1ac7b9d8c&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanLovato","html_url":"https://github.com/NathanLovato","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanLovato/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanLovato/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanLovato/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanLovato/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanLovato/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanLovato/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanLovato/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanLovato/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NathanLovato/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"